Sacrifice algorithm plans
  0.2w + 0.2x + 0.3y + 0.3z

  w = a value that reflects the rarity of the item
  x = a value that reflects the number of sacrifices made at this altar
  y = the number of people in the player's town (potential altar contributors)
  z = the number of sacrifices made recently for that item


